    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "21ba3d37-bbdf-40ee-8aa0-3e404de60b81",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "de79791b-9926-493d-b79c-b0eff7ef42c7",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide in Jersey\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Jersey\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Jersey\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EONE FREE PLACE PER 10 PAYING PASSENGERS\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "3abaff0c-2348-4919-b6b7-71e428c0d99f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 3* Hotel Ambassadeur at St Clement\u2019s Bay. Facilities at the hotel include a restaurant and bar and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "1f2f6e6f-9d36-4f38-8ff5-07d367576e00",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFull day island tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJersey Pearl Centre\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEric Young Orchid Foundation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGlass Church\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJersey War Tunnels\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESt Helier\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMount Orgueil Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESamares Manor\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "5b8322da-20e5-45cd-a33c-f6253ac3f2a4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJersey Museum \u0026amp; Art Gallery - the museum depicts the story of Jersey\u2019s history from Neolithic times to the present day, whilst the art gallery is home to a fine collection of Claude Cahun\u2019s work, recognised worldwide as one of the leading artists of the Surrealist movement\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELa Hougue Bie Museum - home to one of Europe\u2019s finest passage graves, the museum depicts life in Jersey\u2019s Neolithic community 6,000 years ago with a fine collection of ancient coin hoards, axes, swords and spears\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDurrell Wildlife Conservation Trust - founded by the famous writer and naturalist Gerald Durrell, animals that have been saved from extinction include the Assam pygmy hog, St Lucia whiptail lizard and the Mallorcan midwife toad\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "f2acce25-aa4f-4327-b8e3-9eed5b480f4d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 St Clement\u2019s Bay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Jersey from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer in our private executive coach to the 3* Hotel Ambassadeur at St Clement\u2019s Bay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 - Island tour, Jersey Pearl Centre \u0026amp; the Eric Young Orchid Foundation\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFull day panoramic island tour with our Blue Badge guide taking in St Aubin\u0026#39;s Bay, St Brelade\u0026#39;s Bay, Corbiere Lighthouse, St Ouen\u0026#39;s Bay, Greve de Lecq, the Northern Coastline, Gorey Harbour, La Rocque Harbour and St Clement\u0026#39;s Bay \u2013 stop during the tour for photographic opportunities and refreshments together with a visit to the Jersey Pearl Centre \u2013 the Eric Young Orchid Foundation houses one of the finest collections of orchids in the world and features permanently planted landscapes to show the orchids in all their and extravagant beauty.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 - Glass Church, Jersey War Tunnels \u0026amp; St Helier\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESt Matthews Church at Millbrook, known as the Glass Church, boasts opalescent panels, magnificent altar cross, glass font, Jersey lily motif and the perfectly angelic Art Deco angels \u2013 continue to the Jersey War Tunnels, a network of tunnels first created to protect arms and troops from bomb attacks by the Allies and now a superb multimillion pound interactive exhibition that tells the true life stories of the islanders and its foreign prisoners \u2013 afternoon at leisure in St Helier where you may choose to see the Occupation Tapestry produced to commemorate the 50th anniversary of the island\u2019s liberation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 - Mount Orgueil Castle \u0026amp; Samares Manor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuilt in the 13th century to protect the island against the French, the dramatic and wonderfully preserved Mount Orgueil Castle towers over the harbour at Gorey and is one of the most photographed sites on the island \u2013 Samares Manor, a beautiful house dating in part to Norman times, is surrounded by exceptional gardens originally constructed in the 1920s by Sir James Knott featuring the Japanese Garden, rock and water gardens, formal gardens, large ponds with islands and camellia plantations.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 - Home\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning at leisure \u2013 transfer to Jersey Airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
